<title>USA: Sykes Enterprises Q2 net pro forma rises.</title>
<headline>Sykes Enterprises Q2 net pro forma rises.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sykes Enterprises, Incorporated</p>
<p>				Six and Three Months Ended</p>
<p>			   June 29, 1997 and June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		     Six Months Ended	     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>		June 29,	 June 30,     June 29,	June 30,</p>
<p>		 1997	     1996	   1997	    1996</p>
<p>Revenues     $95,135	 $66,724	$48,492	 $33,847</p>
<p>Operating income</p>
<p>		 $12,279	   5,720	  6,590	   2,931</p>
<p>Net income (pro forma for 1996)</p>
<p>		  $8,962	  $3,347	 $4,894	  $1,836</p>
<p>Earnings per share (pro forma for 1996)</p>
<p>		  $0.25	   $0.11	  $0.14	   $0.06</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>		 35,898	  29,359	 35,980	  31,508</p>
<p>		($s in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: -- These figures reflect the completion of two</p>
<p>acquisitions during the quarter utilizing the</p>
<p>pooling-of-interests method of accounting and the Company's</p>
<p>three-for-two stock split of May 19, 1997.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsroom 212-859-1700))</p>
</text>
